  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "This problem has subtasks.\n\nGiven an array BBB containing MMM (where MMM is odd) integers, you have to perform the following operation on BBB until it consists of only a single element.\n\n\nChoose **distinct** indices i,i,i, j,j,j, kkk of the array BBB.\nRemove Bi,Bj,BkB_i, B_j, B_kBi​,Bj​,Bk​ from the array.\nAppend (Bi+Bj−Bk)(B_i + B_j - B_k)(Bi​+Bj​−Bk​) to BBB.\nNote that the operation reduces the length of BBB by 222.\n\nFor example, if B=[2,5,3,4,2]B = [2, 5, 3, 4, 2]B=[2,5,3,4,2], you can choose indices (3,1,4)(3, 1, 4)(3,1,4), delete the values B3,B1,B4B_3, B_1, B_4B3​,B1​,B4​ from BBB, and append B3+B1−B4=3+2−4=1B_3 + B_1 - B_4 = 3+2-4 = 1B3​+B1​−B4​=3+2−4=1 to it, obtaining B=[5,2,1]B = [5, 2, 1]B=[5,2,1].\n\nYour aim is to maximize the value of the final element remaining in the array.\n\nLet this maximum value be f(B)f(B)f(B).\n\nYou are given an array AAA of length NNN. Answer QQQ queries on it.\n\nIn the iii-th query, you are given an integer KiK_iKi​, which is guaranteed to be odd.\n\nCompute f([A1,A2,…,AKi])f([A_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_{K_i}])f([A1​,A2​,…,AKi​​]).\n\nThat is, compute the answer when considering only the first KiK_iKi​ elements of AAA.\n\nEach query is independent, so the array remains unchanged across queries.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of three lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and QQQ — the length of the array and the number of queries.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\nThe third line contains QQQ space-separated integers K1,K2,…,KQK_1, K_2, \\ldots, K_QK1​,K2​,…,KQ​.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output QQQ space-separated numbers: the answers for each query in order.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\leq T \\leq 10^51≤T≤105",
      "1≤N≤2⋅1051 \\leq N \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^51≤N≤2⋅105",
      "1≤Q≤⌈N2⌉1 \\leq Q \\leq \\left\\lceil\\frac{N}{2}\\right\\rceil1≤Q≤⌈2N​⌉",
      "−109≤Ai≤109-10^9 \\leq A_i \\leq 10^9−109≤Ai​≤109 for each 1≤i≤N1 \\leq i \\leq N1≤i≤N",
      "1≤Ki≤N 1 \\leq K_i \\leq N1≤Ki​≤N for each 1≤i≤Q1 \\leq i \\leq Q1≤i≤Q",
      "KiK_iKi​ is odd",
      "The sum of NNN over all test cases won't exceed 2⋅1052 \\cdot 10^52⋅105",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask 1 (30 points):** 1≤Q≤51 \\leq Q \\leq 51≤Q≤5.",
